"description":"Effortlessly remember your daily life with the ultimate no-writing journal and mood tracker.\n\nLooking for a daily journal and mood diary that's a joy, not a chore? \n\nMeet DailyBean, the easiest private diary and life log designed to help you capture your day.\n\nTransform your everyday moments into a beautiful visual journal, reflect on your mood, and keep your memories safe without the pressure of a blank page!\n\nTHE SIMPLEST JOURNAL YOU'LL EVER KEEP\nFaster than a traditional notebook and easier than a bullet journal, DailyBean is an aesthetic journal made for everyone.\nWhether you need a quick brain dump or a mental health journal to manage your emotions, it fits perfectly into your routine. It acts as your safe space and private venting journal when you need it, and a wellness habit tracker when you want to focus on self-care and mood tracking.\n\nRECORD YOUR DAY IN SECONDS\nNo blank pages, no typing required. Logging your life is as simple as a few taps: \n• Choose your mood bean to start your daily journal entry and log your mood. \n• Tap icons to record your activities, routines, meals, and more. \n• Add a quick photo and a short note to create a wholesome journal entry.\n\nPERSONALIZE YOUR AESTHETIC\nJournal DailyBean isn't just functional; it’s a beautifully cute journal you’ll love to use: \n• 100% Customizable: Build your own custom blocks. Add or remove category blocks to track exactly what matters to you. \n• Beautiful Themes: Decorate your kawaii journal with aesthetic themes newly released every month. \n• Watch Your Year Bloom: See your colorful year in pixels come to life on your monthly mood calendar!\n\nDISCOVER YOUR LIFE PATTERNS\nUse our built-in mood tracker features to uncover insights about yourself: \n• Smart Analytics: Understand your mental health with easy-to-read charts. See how your daily habits and activities affect your overall mood flow. \n• Auto-Sync Magic: Connect health data, sleep, and weather for a richer, effortless everything log.\n\nYOUR SECRET DIARY STAYS YOURS\nDailyBean, a completely private journal, respects your moods and values security: \n• Secure your safe space with a lock (PIN or Face ID). \n• Safely back up and restore your records so you never lose your precious memories.\n\nMAKE EVERY DAY COUNT\nSay goodbye to the guilt of leaving a notebook blank. Start your self-care journal journey today, understand your emotions, improve your mental health, and track your mood with ease.\n\nDownload DailyBean now and start building the easiest journaling habit you’ll ever have!\n\nIf you have any questions or feedback while using the app, please contact us here!\nEmail: dailybean@bluesignum.com\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/dailybean_official/", "bundleId":"com.bluesignum.harukong", "userRatingCount":70956}]
